@startuml bounded-contexts
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
title Bounded Contexts — «Будущее 2.0» (DDD)

' === Домены и bounded contexts ===

package "Fintech Domain" #E8F5E9 {
  rectangle "Account Management\n(Управление счетами)" as BC_Account
  rectangle "Credit Management\n(Управление кредитами)" as BC_Credit
  rectangle "Payment Processing\n(Обработка платежей)" as BC_Payment
}

package "Medical Domain" #E3F2FD {
  rectangle "Patient Registry\n(Реестр пациентов)" as BC_Patient
  rectangle "Clinical Operations\n(Клинические операции)" as BC_Clinical
  rectangle "Inventory Management\n(Управление инвентарём)" as BC_Inventory
  rectangle "Personnel Management\n(Управление персоналом)" as BC_Personnel
}

package "AI / Clinical Decision Domain" #FFF3E0 {
  rectangle "Clinical AI\n(Клинический ИИ)" as BC_AI
  rectangle "Research & Diagnostics\n(Исследования и диагностика)" as BC_Research
}

package "Analytics Domain" #F3E5F5 {
  rectangle "Reporting & BI\n(Отчётность и BI)" as BC_Reporting
}

package "Partner Integration Domain" #ECEFF1 {
  rectangle "External Data Ingestion\n(Приём внешних данных)" as BC_External
}

' === Связи (Customer-Supplier / Conformist / ACL) ===

BC_Account -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes events
BC_Credit -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes events
BC_Payment -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes events

BC_Patient -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes (aggregated)
BC_Patient -right-> BC_Clinical : uses
BC_Clinical -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes (aggregated)
BC_Clinical -right-> BC_AI : requests analysis
BC_Inventory -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes events
BC_Personnel -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes events

BC_AI -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes metrics
BC_AI -left-> BC_Clinical : returns results
BC_Research -down-> BC_Reporting : publishes metrics
BC_Research -left-> BC_Clinical : uses

BC_External -down-> BC_Patient : feeds
BC_External -down-> BC_Clinical : feeds
BC_External -down-> BC_Inventory : feeds

note right of BC_Reporting
  **Analytics Domain** — подписчик событий
  из всех доменов. Не публикует
  доменные события (read model).
end note

note bottom of BC_AI
  **AI Domain** — подписчик на события
  из Medical (запросы на анализ),
  публикует результаты и метрики.
end note

@enduml
